// Creatures of the deep woods (reached through the dangerous door north of
// the clearing): built-in special attacks, loot, and a creature with its own
// scripted fight that reads its state during the fight.

// Creatures more than one level above the player are not met, so these two
// are level 1 like the player's other foes.
//
// A built-in special: `pounce 30%` (double damage, no shield) with its own
// text. Other built-ins are grapple, hump and firebreath. `loot` drops after a
// win, with the chance given (feats' `loot bonus` and perception add to it).
== creature wild_boar
name: Wild Boar
found in: deep_woods
level: 1
hp: 18
damage: 4
stats: strength 14, dexterity 9, stamina 14, perception 10, intelligence 4, charisma 6
gender: male
infectious: no
tags: woodland
special: pounce 30%
loot: truffle 50%
encounter:
    A bristly boar shoulders out of the undergrowth, snuffling, and lowers its tusks at you.
attack:
    [one of]The boar shoves you with its snout![or]The boar slashes at your legs with a tusk![at random]
pounce:
    The boar charges, head down, and slams into you with its whole weight!
defeated:
    The boar squeals and crashes away through the ferns.
victory:
    The boar knocks you flat, roots through your pockets for anything edible and wanders off.

// A creature with its own fight. Each round it first runs `each round`, then
// the first of its `attacks:` whose condition holds (that is its whole turn);
// otherwise it attacks normally (`attack` text and a hit roll).
// During the fight, `enemy.hp` and the other `enemy.*` values are its state.
== creature mossback_stag
name: Mossback Stag
found in: deep_woods
level: 1
hp: 20
damage: 4
stats: strength 15, dexterity 13, stamina 14, perception 14, intelligence 6, charisma 12
gender: male
infectious: no
tags: woodland
encounter:
    An old stag steps between the trees, moss hanging from his antlers like a beard. He lowers his head.
each round:
    // Hurt badly, he gives up: "~ win fight" ends the fight as the player's win.
    if enemy.hp < 7:
        The stag snorts, tosses his antlers and bounds away between the trees.
        ~ win fight
attacks:
    * Charge [if chance 1 in 3]
        The stag lowers his antlers and charges.
        // A visible roll; on a hit, a strike for one and a half times his damage.
        if enemy hits:
            ~ enemy strike 150%
        else:
            You throw yourself aside and the stag thunders past.
    * Stamp [if enemy.round > 2 and chance 1 in 4]
        The stag rears and stamps the ground. Leaves and needles shower down around you.
        ~ enemy.dodge_bonus + 2
attack:
    [one of]The stag jabs at you with his antlers![or]The stag kicks out with a hoof![at random]
defeated:
    The stag is gone. A few strands of moss hang from the branches where he passed.
victory:
    The stag knocks you down, looks at you for a long moment, and walks away.
